IASetInputLayout, OMSetBlendState, OMSetDepthStencilState and RSSetState did a QueryInterface (virtual call,
GUID compares, AddRef and Release) per call. Every such object of the device implements the IMTLD3D11
interface by single inheritance, so a static cast is enough. State switching per draw: -16% app thread submit time.

